1
00:00:00,702 --> 00:00:01,782
(Raj:)-No.
-Star Wars?

2
00:00:01,954 --> 00:00:03,164
(Raj:)No.

3
00:00:03,872 --> 00:00:08,622
Um, Stan Lee. Oh, he was in those goofy
kung fu movies you love so much?

4
00:00:09,002 --> 00:00:10,922
(Leonard:)That's Bruce Lee.

5
00:00:11,338 --> 00:00:12,378
(Sheldon:)Oh.

6
00:00:12,547 --> 00:00:15,137
(Penny:)So is this Bruce Lee's
nerdy brother, Stan?

7
00:00:16,677 --> 00:00:20,677
(Howard:)Sheldon, why do you have all these
unopened paychecks in your desk?

8
00:00:20,847 --> 00:00:25,307
(Sheldon:)Because most of the things I'm planning
to buy haven't been invented yet.

9
00:00:25,811 --> 00:00:28,021
(Howard:)There must be thousands
of dollars here.

10
00:00:28,188 --> 00:00:30,978
(Howard:)-Why don't you put it in the bank?
-I don't trust banks.

11
00:00:31,149 --> 00:00:35,609
(Sheldon:)I believe that when the robots rise up,
ATMs will lead the charge.

12
00:00:36,989 --> 00:00:40,329
(Howard:)You've also got something
from the Pasadena Municipal Court.

13
00:00:40,659 --> 00:00:44,039
(Sheldon:)Undoubtedly yet another snide response
to my repeated letters...

14
00:00:44,204 --> 00:00:48,044
(Sheldon:)...complaining that the flags in front of
the courthouse are in the wrong order.

15
00:00:48,208 --> 00:00:52,048
(Sheldon:)It's supposed to be federal, state,
and then city of Pasadena.

16
00:00:52,462 --> 00:00:57,022
(Penny:)I'm sorry, you sent more than one letter
about that?

